// Full translations of the GEL.IT.UP Ambassador Guidelines body, section by
// section, so the generated PDF can be rendered in the applicant's own
// language. English (src/data/ambassadorAgreement.js → AGREEMENT_SECTIONS) is
// the REFERENCE version and is always included after the translation.
//
// Keys map to SUPPORTED_LANGS in src/lib/i18n.js (el, fr, de, es, bg, pl, ro, pt,
// hu, sq). English is intentionally omitted — the PDF renders it from the source.
// Each language's `sections` mirrors AGREEMENT_SECTIONS one to one: same order,
// same number of points, same `strict` flag. Numbers and the Drive link are
// interpolated from the source constants so translations stay in sync.

